# Design System Rules for Capital Craft Project

## Design System Structure

### 1. Token Definitions
- **Location**: `templates/capitalcraft/less/_variables.less`
- **Format**: LESS variables with semantic naming
- **Structure**: Colors, typography, spacing, breakpoints defined as variables

**Key Tokens:**
```less
// Colors
@color-accent: #8d222c;
@color-heading: #000000;
@color-text: #333333;
@color-bg-craft: #fdfbf5;
@color-white: #ffffff;
@section-divider-color: #000000;

// Typography
@font-body: 'Golos Text', sans-serif;
@font-title: 'Onest', sans-serif;
@font-size-base: 16px;
@font-size-text: @font-size-base;
@font-size-sub: @font-size-base * 0.8;
@font-size-title: @font-size-base * 1.8;

// Spacing
@gap: 30px;
@section-padding: 60px;
@radius: 6px;
```

### 2. Component Library
- **Location**: `templates/capitalcraft/pages/home/`
- **Architecture**: BEM methodology with semantic HTML structure
- **Pattern**: Left content (title + description) + Right content (main content)

**Component Structure:**
```html
<section class="block-name frame section-with-divider" id="block-name">
    <div class="container block-name__container">
        <div class="block-name__wrapper">
            <div class="block-name__left">
                <div class="block-name__eyebrow">eyebrow text</div>
                <h2 class="block-name__title">Main title</h2>
                <p class="block-name__desc">Description text</p>
            </div>
            <div class="block-name__right">
                <!-- Main content -->
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
```

### 3. Frameworks & Libraries
- **UI Framework**: Joomla template system with PHP
- **Styling**: LESS with custom compilation
- **Build System**: LESS compilation to CSS
- **No JavaScript frameworks detected**

### 4. Asset Management
- **Location**: `templates/capitalcraft/images/`
- **Structure**: Organized by page/component (e.g., `images/home/`)
- **Format**: WebP for images, SVG for icons
- **Referencing**: Absolute paths from template root

### 5. Icon System
- **Location**: `templates/capitalcraft/images/home/`
- **Format**: SVG files
- **Naming**: Descriptive names (e.g., `icon-team-home.svg`)
- **Usage**: `<img>` tags with alt text

### 6. Styling Approach
- **Methodology**: BEM (Block Element Modifier)
- **Global Styles**: Base styles in `base.less`
- **Responsive**: Media queries nested under component classes
- **Mobile First**: Mobile styles defined first, then overridden for desktop

**Responsive Pattern:**
```less
.block {
  // Desktop styles
  
  .media(mobile, {
    // Mobile overrides
  });
}
```

### 7. Project Structure
- **Template**: Joomla-based template system
- **Pages**: Organized by page type in `pages/` directory
- **Components**: Reusable components in `components/` directory
- **Styling**: LESS files compiled to CSS in `css/` directory

## Integration Guidelines

### For Figma Integration:
1. **Follow BEM naming convention**
2. **Use existing color tokens from `_variables.less`**
3. **Maintain responsive structure with mobile-first approach**
4. **Keep component structure consistent with existing blocks**
5. **Use semantic HTML elements**
6. **Include proper alt text for images**
7. **Follow existing spacing and typography patterns**

### Component Creation Process:
1. Create PHP template file in appropriate directory
2. Create corresponding LESS file
3. Import LESS file in main stylesheet
4. Follow existing responsive patterns
5. Use existing design tokens
6. Test mobile and desktop layouts
